      "statement": "Florida homeowners appetite and referral rules are internal underwriting controls rather than policy terms, while OIR-2023-04 is a regulatory overlay for Florida personal residential property policies issued or renewed on or after 2023-07-01; the bulletin does not itself attach endorsements, select a deductible, or decide coverage.",
