      "id": "claim_993a3b87a5a3479781411a3cb049da48",
      "statement": "Florida base appetite is limited to owner-occupied one-family primary residences with Coverage A from $200,000 to $900,000 and insurance to at least 80% of replacement cost; masonry and masonry veneer are eligible in approved counties, while frame requires protection class 1-5 and location outside the wind-borne debris region, and seasonal or secondary residences are outside appetite.",
      "evidence": [
