      "statement": "For Florida roofs aged 15 years or more, internal guidance requires inspection before binding; for bulletin-scope policies an insurer-required inspection is insurer-paid, qualifying insured-provided F.2 inspection evidence must be accepted without a second insured-paid inspection in the policy period, and the insurer must accept Florida-licensed inspectors rather than require its own selection.",
